<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\Good_bye.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "900" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\超炭酸0.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\超炭酸ボンバー川.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\カウボーイ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Hey, you bastards! The day has finally come when a human flies through the sky on a convenience-store drink! 
{PAUSE ""}
　
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\超炭酸.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
What I've got here is Super Soda Bomber, which just went on sale in Japan the other day! 
{PAUSE ""}
　<BR>
The bottle can alone weighs 1 kilogram!<PG>
Okay, first let's test how far one bottle flies!
{PAUSE ""}
　The method is the same as a bottle rocket! Except we don't pump in any air, we just shake the bottle. 
{PAUSE ""}
Set it on the bottle-rocket stand, press this switch, and the cap opens automatically.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\SE\muci_fan_10.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\超炭酸ボンバー1本.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "0" "14" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\No_Escape.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
This is Super Soda Bomber No. 1, rigged up bottle-rocket style!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Okay, first we test its power with this!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\超炭酸ボンバー川.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\アイテム\超炭酸飛ばす前.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "540" "100" "14" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n-300\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n284\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n-300\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n284\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
Now, how far will it fly?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Here comes the countdown!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
3, 
{PAUSE ""}
2, 
{PAUSE ""}
1, 
{PAUSE ""}
Fire!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tackle1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "14" "100" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{QUAKESTOP "1000"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\アイテム\超炭酸小.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "-15" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n200\r\n2000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n200\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n11\r\n0\r\n500\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
Amazing! It flew right over a 300-foot-wide river!
{PAUSE ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<BR>
Sending a 1.5 kg object flying 300 feet isn't ordinary power!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With this... 
{PAUSE ""}
my dream might come true!<PG>
I weigh 60 kilos.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What happens if I strap on 60 Super Soda Bombers?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've got to do it!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\SE\muci_fan_10.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\超炭酸60本.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "14" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
This is the Crazy Rocket, Crazy Cowboy spec!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I put a board over the top of it and ride on it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then, I wonder what'll happen when I open the caps all at once!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\超炭酸ボンバー川.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\カウボーイ鎧.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Since Super Soda Bomber is made in Japan, this time I went samurai style with my protective gear!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By my calculations, it should keep plenty of power even with the weight of this gear!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Plus, the state police are helping out, and we've got a rescue team stationed on the river!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All that's left... 
{PAUSE ""}
all that's left is for me to get mentally ready, and we're good...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\カウボーイ鎧反転.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Okay, it's finally the moment a human becomes a bird on a convenience-store drink!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wait a second...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Let me take a few deep breaths.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't sleep at all last night imagining this moment.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm excited, but inside, I'm really scared...<PG>
Okay... here I go...<PG>
3, 
{PAUSE ""}
2, 
{PAUSE ""}
1...<PG>
Ah, wait a second! Let me take one more deep breath!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sorry, I've made up my mind now.<PG>
Okay, I'm gonna be a bird! I'm gonna flap into the sky! The first samurai in the world to fly, that's what I'm gonna be!<PG>
{PLAYSND "環境音\鼓動1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
3, 
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "環境音\鼓動1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
2, 
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "環境音\鼓動1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
1, 
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
Go!
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\爆発.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "14" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂飛込み.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "700" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
Heeey! Help me, quick!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The gear's heavy, I'm sinking...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\Good_bye.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\超炭酸ボンバー川.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\カウボーイ鎧.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Hah... hah... somehow I made it back alive.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Everyone, I'm really sorry. Looks like the force of the blast knocked the camera over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To report the result: as expected, I couldn't go the full 300 feet, but I should've flown 200 feet.<PG>
If I'd made it to the far bank with that momentum, I'd have been smashed to smithereens.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was very lucky to fly only 200 feet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's probably only a matter of time before Super Soda Bomber is regulated by law in Japan.<PG>
Before that happens, all you with heart! Take up where I left off and fly off into space!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The day humans become birds is near!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\超炭酸0.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"This old guy is way too reckless..."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
